      "value": "Once more it was not my own incapability but a mere bug.\nPlease fix this asap. It is great for microphones and lots of other stuff. Found this bug only 2 hours after updating my world with that component. How could you miss that in Beta guys? \n\nEDIT: I went to my world with a group of ten people and one of them told me he could hear another user all over the map(as if standing inside the trigger zone). No other player had this problem. And noone was standing in the zone anymore. The range was 50 units, way smaller than the map itself. Did not test any further but this may be related to the above mentioned bug.",
      "viewerReactions": null
